  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4f57265f2d95884493f924517248368, type: 3}
  m_Name: OldMan 4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialougeText
  paragraphs:
  - Hmm... oh yes the hat. Well anyhow that tar stuff did give me powers!
  - I could sense the ground around me ya'know, could see the inside of things and
    the earth without having to dig it up.
  - Some kind of new sense if you will.
  - Never used it for much though. Except to fix a bike. Shoot, I could tell you
    what was wrong with a bike after just a minute of feeling it up!
  - Nobody belived my powers but I was bang on about the bike everytime! I swears
    it.
  - Anyhow, it helps now without me eyes an all. I can sense you, traveler. In some
    ways, I can see you there...
